    "number": 36482,
    "state": "open",
    "locked": false,
    "maintainer_can_modify": true,
    "title": "wallet: Only broadcast resubmitted transactions that were added to the mempool",
    "user": {
      "login": "achow101",
      "id": 3782274,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM3ODIyNzQ=",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3782274?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/achow101",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/achow101",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/achow101/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/achow101/following%7B/other_user%7D",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/achow101/gists%7B/gist_id%7D",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/achow101/starred%7B/owner%7D%7B/repo%7D",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/achow101/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/achow101/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/achow101/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/achow101/events%7B/privacy%7D",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/achow101/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "As discussed in #36403, one of the issues with current rebroadcast behavior is that the rebroadcast begins an unconditional relay of a transaction to peers. While this is broadcast is limited to peers that have not previously been inv'd the transaction, there is still a privacy leak in this double relay of a transaction, especially so for transactions that are still in nodes' mempools.\r\n\r\nThis PR changes the rebroadcast to only rebroadcast transactions if the transaction was not already present in our mempool. This provides some additional privacy while retaining intended rebroadcast behavior as transactions that have likely fallen out of nodes' mempools are the ones that actually need to be rebroadcast.\r\n\r\nThe wallet rebroadcast tests are additionally refactored for isolation so that their behaviors can still be tested after this change. Additionally, a test for the loading resubmission was added, as well as a test for the new behavior.",
